-## 1. ⚠️ THE PROBLEM: EVERY SESSION STARTS FROM ZERO
-
-AI coding assistants have amnesia. Every session starts from zero.
-
-You explain your architecture Monday. By Wednesday, it is gone. Decisions, trade-offs, the carefully reasoned choices behind them, all lost the moment the conversation window closes.
-
-And memory is only the first casualty:
-
-- **Changes ship undocumented.** Nothing records why a decision was made, so the next session - or the next teammate - has to reverse-engineer it.
-- **"Done" is whatever the agent claims.** No gate stands between a confident answer and a verified one.
-- **Every task starts cold.** The assistant reloads the same context, asks the same questions and repeats the same mistakes.
-- **One model does every job.** The same weights plan the work, write the code and review their own output.
-
-This framework fixes that.
-
